Description: A 'DBI' driver for 'libzugodb'
    (<https://github.com/pedrobtz/libzugodb>), a small columnar SQL engine
    derived from 'SlothDB' (<https://github.com/SouravRoy-ETL/slothdb>),
    whose C++ source is bundled and compiled when the package is
    installed. SQL queries over local 'CSV', 'Parquet'
    and 'JSON' files, and over in-memory or file-backed
    databases, then need no system library, no server and no download.
    The engine is experimental, and this package is not a replacement for
    'duckdb': it is offline only, and a database file is tied to the
    engine commit the package bundles.
